  "design": ["§6 Derived supersession: same partition; the superseder's origin at or above the target's (`imported > external`); not a candidate; archiving or forgetting a replacement does not revive what it replaced", "§7a control snapshot tombstones", "§3 rule 3: same-`fact_key` losers"],
